#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/installation.rst:212
msgid ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_*`` 环境变量是全局 LLM API 配置，用于模型调用。智能体自身的行为（如 "
"``max_react_turns``、``enable_todo_list``、``disabled_skill_ids``）不通过环境变量设置，而是在实验配置的 "
"``AgentConfig.kwargs`` 中按智能体指定，见 :ref:`agent-config`。"
msgstr ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_*`` environment variables are the global LLM API configuration used for model "
"calls. Agent behavior itself (such as ``max_react_turns``, ``enable_todo_list``, and "
"``disabled_skill_ids``) is not configured through environment variables; it is specified per "
"agent in ``AgentConfig.kwargs`` in the experiment configuration. See :ref:`agent-config`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/installation.rst:218
msgid "LLM 调度与本地并发控制"
msgstr "LLM Dispatch and Local Concurrency Control"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/installation.rst:217
msgid ""
"LLM 调度由可序列化的 ``LLMClient`` 完成。每个 Ray task、env router actor 或 driver 进程在自己的事件循环中首次调用 LLM 时，本地创建 "
"litellm Router 与 ``AdaptiveSemaphore``。 ``AdaptiveSemaphore`` 基于近期延迟和 rate-limit 错误做 AIMD 自适应并发。"
msgstr ""
"LLM dispatch is handled by serializable ``LLMClient`` instances. When each Ray task, env router "
"actor, or driver process calls an LLM for the first time in its own event loop, it creates a "
"local litellm Router and ``AdaptiveSemaphore``. ``AdaptiveSemaphore`` adapts concurrency with "
"AIMD based on recent latency and rate-limit errors."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/installation.rst:220
msgid ""
"# Ray CPU 预算（ray.init 的 num_cpus）：封顶每 tick 同时运行的 step_agent_batch\n"
"# Ray Task 数。默认取机器 CPU 核数；调低可为 driver / env actor / trace 留出空间。\n"
"# export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS=8\n"
"\n"
"# 每个本地 LLMClient 的 AIMD 初始并发；无人工上下限，由 AIMD 依延迟/限流自由自调节。\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY=16\n"
"\n"
"# 每个 step_agent_batch Ray Task 处理的 agent 数；task 数 = ⌈N / BATCH_SIZE⌉，\n"
"# 应 ≥ 同时运行的 worker 数才能打满 CPU（CLI --batch-size 可覆盖）。\n"
"# export AGENTSOCIETY_BATCH_SIZE=256\n"
"\n"
"# AIMD “慢调用”判定\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_LATENCY_DEGRADE_FACTOR=4.0   # 相对退避因子（相对健康基线的倍数）\n"
"# export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_SLOW_LATENCY_MS=8000       # 可选：绝对延迟 SLO（毫秒）"
msgstr ""
"# Ray CPU budget (ray.init num_cpus) caps concurrent step_agent_batch\n"
"# Ray Tasks per tick. Defaults to CPU count; lower it to leave capacity for the driver, env "
"actor, and trace.\n"
"# export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS=8\n"
"\n"
"# Initial AIMD concurrency per local LLMClient; adapts to latency and rate limits without manual "
"bounds.\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY=16\n"
"\n"
"# Agents per step_agent_batch Ray Task; task count = ceil(N / BATCH_SIZE).\n"
"# Keep this at least as large as the active worker count to fill CPU capacity; CLI --batch-size "
"overrides it.\n"
"# export AGENTSOCIETY_BATCH_SIZE=256\n"
"\n"
"# AIMD slow-call detection\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_LATENCY_DEGRADE_FACTOR=4.0   # Backoff factor relative to the healthy "
"baseline\n"
"# export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_SLOW_LATENCY_MS=8000       # Optional absolute latency SLO in "
"milliseconds"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/installation.rst:239
msgid ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY`` 只是 AIMD 的起点，没有人工上下限——每进程并发会根据近期响应调整，并在延迟或限流恶化时回退。若网关有严格 QPS "
"上限可调低起点；实际总并发还取决于同时运行的 Ray task 数（``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS``）。"
msgstr ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY`` is the AIMD starting point, not a manual bound. Per-process "
"concurrency adjusts to recent responses and backs off when latency or rate limiting worsens. "
"Lower the starting point for strict gateway QPS limits; total concurrency also depends on "
"simultaneous Ray tasks (``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS``)."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/installation.rst:250
msgid "独立启动后端"
msgstr "Start the standalone backend"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/installation.rst:252
msgid "插件可管理后端进程；使用 REST API 或自行排查时，也可在研究工作区根目录启动。使用安装了 SDK 的同一 Python 环境，并先按上文准备模型配置："
msgstr ""
